narrative:
I had to contact XXXX because my account was on hold and I needed to transfer funds. The rep I spoke to instructed me to call him back so he could remove the hold. I did so once the money was in my bank account. 

He instructed me to initiate another dummy transfer to reactivate my account. After transferring the money, he cut the line. I called back but the line was no longer active. 

I immediately called my bank and they could not cancel the transaction. I lost {$3800.00}
